        <mxCell id="9xSVB8YvGXu8nV1T8kcD-96" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Linux 内核中用于&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;控制&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: 100%; line-height: 22px; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-language-override: normal; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Cascadia Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Ubuntu Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Fira Code&amp;quot;, Cousine, &amp;quot;Roboto Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, Courier, sans-serif, system-ui; background-color: rgb(235, 238, 242); border-radius: 6px; align-items: center; padding: 0px 5px; display: inline-flex;&quot;&gt;initcall&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;（初始化调用）调试日志功能&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;的标准实现模式。它通过一个内核启动参数和系统文件（sysfs）接口，让开发者和系统管理员能够动态控制是否在启动过程中打印详细的初始化函数执行信息。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
